<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>CSuiteFinder — work email lookup API</title>
<meta name="description" content="Resolve a name and a company domain to a work email. Deliverability, enrichment, patterns and company data. <%= @trial_tokens %> free tokens to start.">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #fbfaf8;
    --surface: #ffffff;
    --border: #e4e0d9;
    --text: #1c1a17;
    --muted: #6b6560;
    --accent: #b8541f;
    --accent-soft: #fdf1e8;
    --code-bg: #f5f2ee;
    --ok: #2f6b45;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --bg: #161513;
      --surface: #1e1d1a;
      --border: #33302b;
      --text: #ece8e2;
      --muted: #a09990;
      --accent: #e8834a;
      --accent-soft: #2a1d14;
      --code-bg: #131210;
      --ok: #7bbd93;
    }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font: 16px/1.65 ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  .wrap { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }
  header { padding: 72px 0 40px; }
  .logo {
    font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-size: 15px;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 6vw, 52px); line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 20px; font-weight: 700;
  }
  .lede { font-size: clamp(17px, 2.4vw, 20px); color: var(--muted); max-width: 62ch; margin: 0 0 32px; }
  h2 {
    font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.09em;
    color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; margin: 64px 0 20px;
    padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  h3 { font-size: 17px; margin: 28px 0 8px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  p { margin: 0 0 16px; }
  a { color: var(--accent); }
  code {
    font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 0.88em; background: var(--code-bg);
    padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;
  }
  pre {
    background: var(--code-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px 20px; overflow-x: auto;
    font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 20px;
  }
  pre code { background: none; padding: 0; font-size: inherit; }
  .step {
    display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: baseline;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .step-n {
    flex: none; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--accent);
    display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700;
    position: relative; top: 4px;
  }
  .cards { display: grid; gap: 14px; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .card {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px;
  }
  .card .big { font-size: 27px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; display: block; }
  .card .label { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }
  .table-scroll { overflow-x: auto; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: 14.5px; min-width: 480px; }
  th, td { text-align: left; padding: 11px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  th { font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
  td code { white-space: nowrap; }
  .num { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; }
  .note {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); background: var(--accent-soft);
    padding: 14px 18px; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .note strong { color: var(--accent); }
  ul { margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 22px; }
  li { margin-bottom: 6px; }
  footer {
    margin-top: 72px; padding: 28px 0 56px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

<header>
  <div class="logo">CSuiteFinder</div>
  <h1>Find anyone's work email from a name and a domain.</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    One token per email found. Deliverability, enrichment, patterns, names and
    company data are all included.
    Start with <strong><%= @trial_tokens %> free tokens</strong> — <%= @trial_tokens %> emails,
    no card, no call.
  </p>
  <pre><code>curl -X POST <%= @base_url %>/csuitefinder/register \
  -H 'content-type: application/json' \
  -d '{"email": "you@company.com"}'</code></pre>
</header>

<h2>Register in one call</h2>

<div class="step"><span class="step-n">1</span><div><strong>Sign up.</strong> Post your email to <code>/csuitefinder/register</code>. You get an API key and <%= @trial_tokens %> tokens (<%= @trial_usd %>) straight back — good for <%= @trial_tokens %> emails.</div></div>
<div class="step"><span class="step-n">2</span><div><strong>Save the key.</strong> It is shown once and stored only as a hash — we cannot recover it for you.</div></div>
<div class="step"><span class="step-n">3</span><div><strong>Call the API.</strong> Send the key as <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;key&gt;</code> on every request.</div></div>
<div class="step"><span class="step-n">4</span><div><strong>Buy tokens when you're ready.</strong> Bundles start at $<%= @min_bundle %>, paid through PayPal.</div></div>

<p>The registration response looks like this:</p>

<pre><code>{
  "account_id": 42,
  "api_key": "csf_live_…",
  "api_key_notice": "Store this key now — it is shown once…",
  "tokens_granted": <%= @trial_tokens %>,
  "token_balance": <%= @trial_tokens %>
}</code></pre>

<h2>Pricing</h2>

<div class="cards">
  <div class="card">
    <span class="big">1 token</span>
    <span class="label">per email found ($<%= @token_price %>)</span>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <span class="big">$<%= @min_bundle %>+</span>
    <span class="label">bundles, <%= @min_bundle_tokens %> tokens</span>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <span class="big"><%= @trial_tokens %></span>
    <span class="label">free trial tokens (<%= @trial_usd %>)</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="table-scroll">
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Endpoint</th><th class="num">Tokens</th><th class="num">Effective</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <%= for {endpoint, tokens, usd} <- @price_rows do %>
    <tr>
      <td><code><%= endpoint %></code></td>
      <td class="num"><%= if tokens > 0, do: tokens, else: "—" %></td>
      <td class="num"><%= if tokens > 0, do: "$" <> usd, else: "included" %></td>
    </tr>
    <% end %>
  </tbody>
</table>
</div>

<div class="note">
  <strong>You pay for emails found — nothing else.</strong> One token per
  resolved address. Deliverability, enrichment, patterns, names and both company
  endpoints are included with any balance. A find that resolves nothing is free, and
  unverified guesses are never billed.
</div>

<p>
  Included endpoints still need a positive token balance to call — a balance is
  what makes you a customer. They just don't spend it.
</p>

<h2>Endpoints</h2>

<div class="table-scroll">
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Method</th><th>Path</th><th>Parameters</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>POST</td><td><code>/csuitefinder/email/find</code></td><td><code>full_name</code>, <code>domain</code>, <code>email (optional)</code></td></tr>
    <tr><td>POST</td><td><code>/csuitefinder/email/deliverable</code></td><td><code>email</code></td></tr>
    <tr><td>POST</td><td><code>/csuitefinder/email/enrich</code></td><td><code>email</code></td></tr>
    <tr><td>POST</td><td><code>/csuitefinder/email/pattern</code></td><td><code>email</code></td></tr>
    <tr><td>POST</td><td><code>/csuitefinder/name/who</code></td><td><code>email</code></td></tr>
    <tr><td>POST</td><td><code>/csuitefinder/company/find</code></td><td><code>email</code> (honestly, any)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>POST</td><td><code>/csuitefinder/company/info</code></td><td><code>email</code></td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
</div>

<h3>Example</h3>

<pre><code>curl -H "Authorization: Bearer $CSF_KEY" \
  "<%= @base_url %>/csuitefinder/email/find?full_name=Jensen%20Huang&domain=nvidia.com"

{
  "email": "jhuang@nvidia.com",
  "full_name": "Jensen Huang",
  "domain": "nvidia.com",
  "found": true,
  "confidence": 0.937638
}</code></pre>


<h2>Managing your account</h2>

<div class="table-scroll">
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Path</th><th>What it does</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td><code>GET /csuitefinder/billing/balance</code></td><td>Token balance and the full price list</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>GET /csuitefinder/billing/usage?days=30</code></td><td>Calls, cache hits and tokens spent per endpoint</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>POST /csuitefinder/billing/topup</code></td><td>Buy a bundle — returns a PayPal approval link</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>GET /csuitefinder/health</code></td><td>Service status</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
</div>

<pre><code>curl -X POST <%= @base_url %>/csuitefinder/billing/topup \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $CSF_KEY" \
  -H 'content-type: application/json' \
  -d '{"amount_usd": <%= @min_bundle %>}'</code></pre>

<footer>
  CSuiteFinder · <a href="/csuitefinder/pricing">pricing as JSON</a> ·
  <a href="/csuitefinder/health">status</a>
</footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>
